  "residence": "吴同文住宅，绿房子，邬达克设计。地址位于铜仁路西、北京西路南，规划院院内北侧。",
  "chronology": [
    {
      "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160627194310id_/http://www.shtong.gov.cn/Newsite/node2/node2245/node75091/node75095/node75115/node75127/userobject1ai90866.html",
